SystemRequirements: C++17; optional Metal backend: Apple Silicon with macOS
    14 or later and Xcode 15 or later; the required Foundation, Accelerate,
    Metal, Metal Performance Shaders, and Metal Performance Shaders Graph
    frameworks are supplied by the Apple SDK; optional CUDA backend: CUDA
    Toolkit with cuFFT, cuBLAS, cuSOLVER, and CUB/Thrust (CCCL); FAISS GPU and
    RAPIDS cuVS for CUDA nearest-neighbor search; RAPIDS RAFT and RMM only when
    CUDA TSVD initialization is enabled.
